+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.version.Version.compare` is deprecated and now emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Passing a :class:`str`, :class:`tuple`, :class:`list` or :class:`~semver.version.Version` is unchanged.
