new file mode 100644
index 0000000..12b47d7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.version.Version.next_version` is deprecated and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use ``token`` instead, which matches :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease` and :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_build`.
